    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/88-glasmore-park-swords-dublin-k67-k596\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 88 Glasmore Park, Swords.\r\n\r\nSituated in the sought-after Glasmore Park, this semi-detached property stands as a testament to modern living, having undergone an extensive renovation in 2017. This charming residence features three bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it an ideal choice for families or those looking to invest in a thriving community.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property presents a classic semi-detached architecture, highlighted by a driveway that accommodates off-street parking. The manicured lawn and well-kept shrubs add to its inviting kerb appeal. Newly installed windows and a front door enhance both security and insulation, complementing the 2025 Bosch gas boiler and rewired systems from 2017 to ensure a warm, efficient home environment.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you're greeted by a spacious living room, notable for its abundance of natural light and welcoming atmosphere. This room seamlessly flows via large doors into a kitchen-diner space, which offers modern cabinetry and ample dining space, perfect for family gatherings. From the kitchen, sliding doors lead to a private garden, an ideal space for outdoor entertainment and relaxation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts three generously sized bedrooms, each equipped with thermostatic radiator valves to maintain comfort. The main bathroom is fitted with contemporary fixtures.\r\n\r\nThe property's location offers easy access to a range of amenities. Local schools and sports clubs are within walking distance, catering to family needs. Excellent transport links include nearby bus stops, ensuring quick access to Dublin city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nWith its thoughtful renovations and strategic location, this property is perfect for first-time buyers seeking a welcoming community, growing families desiring a strategic location, or investors aiming for a rewarding asset. Its blend of modern features and practical layout promises a comfortable, convenient lifestyle."
      },
